    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Hello, in this game you will need to control as a rabbit and jump on platforms
    and collect eggs, in order to jump you will need to hold your finger on the screen
    and select the desired force for the jump, you will not be able to stand on the
    platform for a long time because after 5 seconds the platform disappears, and
    each time the waiting time for the platform decreases and you can fall and lose,
    your goal is to collect as many eggs as possible, can you collect more eggs?

    Good
    luck!'
